   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Sequence for two parallel subagents",
   "originalText": "Sequence for two parallel subagents",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": false
  },
  {
   "id": "e508",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1800,
   "y": 6184,
   "width": 900,
   "height": 230,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#212529",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1620508580,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 124254104,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. S3 and S4 interrupt in the same superstep.\n2. astream returns __interrupt__ with both.\n3. UI shows S3 (1 of 2).\n4. approve S3 → Command(resume={id3: ...})\n5. graph re-interrupts S4; UI shows S4.\n6. approve S4 → graph advances to N7.\n\nWhile paused, no new interrupt can appear.\nAfter each resume, new requests may appear.",
   "originalText": "1. S3 and S4 interrupt in the same superstep.\n2. astream returns __interrupt__ with both.\n3. UI shows S3 (1 of 2).\n4. approve S3 → Command(resume={id3: ...})\n5. graph re-interrupts S4; UI shows S4.\n6. approve S4 → graph advances to N7.\n\nWhile paused, no new interrupt can appear.\nAfter each resume, new requests may appear.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": false
  },
